able and convenient temporary residence for professionals on short-term assignments or individuals in transition between homes. With a focus on functionality and comfort, this apartment provides everything needed for a pleasant stay.  Step into the bright and airy living space, where large windows invite natural light to illuminate the open-plan layout. Relax on the cozy sofa or gather around the dining table for meals and conversations. The apartment comes equipped with a TV and Blu-ray player for entertainment, as well as a selection of books for leisurely reading.  The kitchen is fully equipped with modern appliances, making meal preparation a breeze. Nearby grocery stores, restaurants, a pharmacy, a shopping center, and a cinema ensure that dining options and entertainment are never far away. Plus, with the tram station \"Neustädter Markt\" right outside the door, public transportation options are easily accessible, providing convenient connections to the city center and beyond.  The bedroom offers a peaceful retreat, furnished with a comfortable bed and ample storage space for your belongings. After a day of work or exploration, unwind with a hot shower in the clean and well-appointed bathroom.  For added convenience, a washing machine and dryer are available for use at specified times.  Whether you're seeking temporary accommodation for work or simply looking to experience the charm of the city and its surroundings, this furnished apartment offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"no"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value"